## Practical conclusion

The AWS Lambda function was created using Python and integrated with Amazon DynamoDB. Whenever the function executes, it obtains the current date and time in Indian Standard Time (IST) and stores them in the DynamoDB table.

Important: Ensure that Lambda and DynamoDB are in the same AWS region and that the Lambda execution role has the `dynamodb:PutItem` permission.
